        "original_id": "d2300842-b423-57df-9553-f4cbf26412bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The Arts Fuse, Visionaire\n- People: Gerald Peary, Cecilia Dean\n- Places: Greater Boston, Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, New York, New England\n- Topics: online arts magazines, transmedia companies, arts and culture coverage, art and fashion\n\nFacts:\n- The Arts Fuse is a Boston-based online arts magazine.\n- The Arts Fuse covers cultural events in Greater Boston and in Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, and New York.\n- The Arts Fuse provides a next-generation platform for arts and culture consumers across New England and beyond.\n- Gerald Peary is a critic-at-large for The Arts Fuse.\n- Visionaire is a transmedia company.\n- Visionaire publishes a magazine named Visionaire.\n- Visionaire also conceives, curates, and produces art multiples, events, public art installations, film, branded content, apparel, and publications.\n- Cecilia Dean is a co-founder of Visionaire, a multi-media art and fashion company.",
